Cell["\<\
For a single index, returns PauliMatrix[index]. For several indices, returns \
KroneckerProduct @@ PauliMatrix[{indices}].\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1887575379,ExpressionUUID->"d74f7468-a85f-7e4d-91db-b0eaaf36ff3b"],

Cell["\<\
Use indices 0 through 3, with 0 selecting the 2 by 2 identity matrix. \
